Spec: Bar Plaza Website

Purpose:
  Present Bar Plaza in Pinto with an accessible menu and reliable contact details.

Structure:
  ./src: Astro page, layout, styles, and browser interactions
  ./public: Static assets and hosting response headers
  ./netlify.toml: Netlify build and publish settings
  ./README.md: Local development and deployment instructions

Must:
  The site is a static Astro website that can be hosted on a free commercial-use plan.
  The contact address and phone match the restaurant-provided menu.
  Menu images remain attributed to their rights holders and are excluded from the project code license.
  Locally available content works without paid services or third-party runtime dependencies.
  User-facing pages use Spanish-language semantic HTML and support keyboard access.

Must not:
  Publish unverified business hours or third-party restaurant photos without confirmed reuse rights and a recent date.
  Include secrets, server-side credentials, or paid-service requirements.

Done when:
  npm run build completes and the README documents the local development command and URL.
